          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa avandu vaali nivaziiyi harara na Kalebu vavoola, “Kunyi si kunyala kwingilira vandu yava mba; kigira vaveeye nizinguru kuvita kunyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa valandiza makuva govovehi ku vandu va Isiraeli kigira kivala cha vazia kutunyiriza. Vavoola, “Kivala yicho sikeveeye ni viamo viu kulihiza kali vandu vamenyi mu mba. Vandu vosi vakwalola mu vaali vatambi ligali! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali kwalola mu kivala yiki mindu minene ligali, vaali visukululwi via Anakimu. Kwaloleka kuva vakekeeke kuli amadagalala kuvo, kunangwa nindio kwaloleka imbiri wavo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.33"
            ]
